## Performance Considerations

### Connection Pooling
Reuse gRPC channels instead of creating new ones for each request:

```python
# Good: Reuse channel
class MyService:
    def __init__(self):
        self.channel = grpc.insecure_channel('ai-service:50051')
        self.stub = ai_service_pb2_grpc.AIServiceStub(self.channel)

    def chat(self, message):
        return self.stub.Chat(...)

# Bad: New channel each time
def chat(message):
    channel = grpc.insecure_channel('ai-service:50051')
    stub = ai_service_pb2_grpc.AIServiceStub(channel)
    return stub.Chat(...)
```

### Timeouts
Set appropriate timeouts:

```python
response = stub.Chat(request, timeout=30)  # 30 seconds
```

### Concurrent Requests
The AI Service handles concurrent requests. You can safely make parallel calls.

